  "source": "profile.png",
  "notes": [
    "art/reference/profile.png is YOUR LORDSHIP, the owner's painting of the profile. It gives the two pages opened from its REDEEM A CODE and INVITE A FRIEND rows their page, their icons, a friend's row, the empty box and CLOSE.",
    "Measured by flood-filling each box from its middle: the friend row's name box x 223..508 y 1251..1306, its figure box x 532..639 y 1253..1305, its GIFT face x 667..836 y 1247..1308; CLOSE's face x 552..792 y 1497..1544; the panel inside the frame x 49..891 (gold at 41..48 and 892..898); the portrait ring's gold from r 43 to 48 about (147.5, 1279.3) (its own mirror axis, fitted on its gold), its online light about (191, 1248)."
